Assesses ability to design multi-tenant ingestion with data governance, lineage, and robust error handling on GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Batch Dataflow triggers from Storage finalization and Pub/Sub
- Per-tenant BigQuery datasets and partitioning
- Data Catalog lineage and IAM Conditions for policy enforcement
- Idempotent loads, load manifests, and DLQ
- Rollback strategies and test plans

